---
// AboutSection.astro
---

<section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-inner">

      <div class="about-left">
        <div class="about-svg-wrap">
          <svg width="100%" viewBox="0 0 320 280" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" role="img">
            <title>SDF Clothing Bangladesh Garment Factory Illustration</title>
            <!-- Factory structure -->
            <g stroke="#e00" stroke-width="2" fill="none">
              <rect x="20" y="140" width="280" height="120"/>
              <rect x="40" y="100" width="30" height="45"/>
              <rect x="90" y="115" width="30" height="30"/>
              <rect x="140" y="210" width="40" height="50"/>
            </g>
            <!-- Smoke -->
            <g stroke="#666" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" fill="none">
              <path d="M55 95 Q58 80 55 65 Q52 50 56 38"/>
              <path d="M105 110 Q108 95 105 82 Q102 70 106 58"/>
            </g>
            <!-- Windows -->
            <g stroke="#888" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none">
              <rect x="40" y="155" width="35" height="30"/>
              <rect x="90" y="155" width="35" height="30"/>
              <rect x="140" y="155" width="35" height="30"/>
              <rect x="190" y="155" width="35" height="30"/>
              <rect x="240" y="155" width="35" height="30"/>
            </g>
            <!-- Sewing machine -->
            <g stroke="#e00" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none">
              <ellipse cx="70" cy="220" rx="25" ry="8"/>
              <rect x="55" y="195" width="30" height="25"/>
              <path d="M70 195 L70 175 L85 175"/>
              <circle cx="85" cy="172" r="5"/>
            </g>
            <!-- Fabric roll -->
            <g fill="none">
              <ellipse cx="255" cy="215" rx="12" ry="20" stroke="#e00" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <rect x="243" y="195" width="24" height="40" stroke="#666" stroke-width="1"/>
              <g stroke="#888" stroke-width="1">
                <line x1="243" y1="205" x2="267" y2="205"/>
                <line x1="243" y1="215" x2="267" y2="215"/>
                <line x1="243" y1="225" x2="267" y2="225"/>
              </g>
            </g>
            <!-- Detail elements -->
            <path d="M200 180 Q210 160 220 180 Q230 200 240 180" stroke="#e00" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="2 2" fill="none"/>
            <line x1="10" y1="260" x2="310" y2="260" stroke="#333" stroke-width="2"/>
            <text x="160" y="278" text-anchor="middle" fill="#888" font-size="9" font-family="system-ui,sans-serif" letter-spacing="3">BANGLADESH · EST. 1998</text>
            <!-- Accent dots -->
            <g fill="#e00">
              <circle cx="160" cy="60" r="3"/>
              <circle cx="145" cy="50" r="2" opacity="0.5"/>
              <circle cx="175" cy="50" r="2" opacity="0.5"/>
              <circle cx="135" cy="65" r="1.5" opacity="0.3"/>
              <circle cx="185" cy="65" r="1.5" opacity="0.3"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-right">
        <div class="section-header about-header">
          <span class="section-label">About SDF Clothing</span>
          <span class="accent-line"></span>
          <h2 id="about-heading">Bangladesh Clothing Manufacturer Since 1998</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Founded in 1998 by Chowdhury Remon, SDF started as a small cut-and-sew unit and has since grown into a vertically integrated <a href="/clothing-manufacturers/" style="color:#fff;border-bottom:0.6px solid #333;">clothing manufacturer</a> handling everything in-house — from yarn and fabric through to final inspection and export packing. We run four production sites, employ over 2,000 people, and ship to brands across 60+ countries.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every order goes through in-house pattern grading, fabric sourcing, knitting or weaving, dyeing, <strong>cut and sew</strong>, and <strong>AQL 2.5</strong> final inspection — all on our own premises with no sub-contractors involved. We produce <strong>OEM</strong>, <strong>ODM</strong>, and <strong>CMT</strong> orders for woven and <strong>knitwear</strong> garments, and our sampling team turns around proto samples in 14 days.
        </p>
        <p>
          We hold 13 active international certifications: <strong>GOTS 7.0</strong> for organic cotton, <strong>OEKO-TEX Standard 100</strong>, <strong>ISO 9001:2015</strong>, <strong>ISO 14001</strong>, <strong>BSCI</strong>, <strong>SEDEX SMETA</strong>, <strong>WRAP</strong>, <strong>SA8000</strong>, <strong>C-TPAT</strong>, <strong>GRS</strong>, <strong>OCS</strong>, <strong>RCS</strong>, and <strong>BCI</strong>. Certificate numbers are published on our <a href="/certifications" style="color:#fff;border-bottom:0.6px solid #333;">certifications page</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          We work exclusively with B2B clients — fashion labels, wholesale buyers, and <strong>private label</strong> brands placing orders from <strong>300 pieces per style</strong>. Pricing is <strong>FOB Chittagong</strong>, covering fabric, cut and sew, AQL inspection, and export packing. Most of our clients are based in the EU, UK, North America, and Australia, and many have been working with us for over five years.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .about-svg-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  @media (min-width: 901px) {
    .about-svg-wrap {
      margin-top: -2rem;
    }
  }
  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .about-right p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1.9;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .about-right strong {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .about-svg-wrap {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
